{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20046","headline":"献襄阳于大夫 · 孟郊","name":"献襄阳于大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"襄阳青山郭，汉江白铜堤。\n谢公领兹郡，山水无尘泥。\n铁马万霜雪，绦旗千虹霓。\n风漪参差泛，石板重叠跻。\n旧泪不复堕，新欢居然齐。\n还畊竟原野，归老相扶携。\n物色增暧暧，寒芳更萋萋。\n渊清有遐略，高躅无近蹊。\n即此富苍翠，自然引翔栖。\n曩游常抱忆，夙好今尚暌。\n愿言从逸辔，暇日凌清溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}